Description: region screenshot tool with annotation and upload
 Press a hotkey, drag over the part of the screen you want, mark it up with
 pen, line, arrow, rectangle, circle, marker, text and blur tools, then copy
 it, save it, print it or upload it to Imgur or your own server.
 .
 Works on X11 and Wayland (GNOME, KDE, wlroots compositors).
